        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyuuth luaak Kuɔth mi bi ben",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ dhieec runi pɛɛcäda, kɛ tuk runä mɔmɔ, kɛ wäl ni̱ni kä pay, kɛ wäl ŋuaan runi kɛ kɔr kä mëë ca wec da̱k piny, kɛ jɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ, cu buɔ̱m Kuɔth Nhial ben kä ɣä, cuɛ ɣä naŋ ɛn wani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ɣä nööŋ guäth mi cua̱ nyuuth Kuɔth ben nɛn thi̱n, muun I-thɛ-rɛl. Kä cuɛ ɣä nyuɔ̱ɔ̱r wi̱i̱ pa̱a̱m mi bäär, mi te mi ce̱tkɛ wec thi̱n kui̱c cuëëcdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë cɛ ɣä naŋ ɛn wani, tëë kɛ wut mi te ɛn wani, mi ce̱t ta̱a̱dɛ kɛ ciɛk in yian, mi tekɛ lath thëm mi gɔaa, kä te tetdɛ kɛ ta̱y thëm mi gɔaa. Kä tëë cuŋä thok kal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ruac kɛ ɣä wëë i̱, “Gat ran, ji̱n gui̱cni kä li̱ŋni agɔaa, kä läthni lɔcdu kä ŋɔak diaal tin bä nyuɔ̱th ji̱, kɛ ɣöö nööŋkɛ ji̱ ɛn guäth ɛmɛ kɛ ɣöö bä ŋɔak ti̱ti̱ ben nyuɔ̱th ji̱. Kä lätni tin diaal tin ci nɛn ji̱ thuɔk duëël I-thɛ-rɛl.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Thok kal in te peek känyä ca̱ŋ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛn wanɛ mɔ tëë kɛ päny mi ca go̱l ni luaak Kuɔth raar. Kä theem gutdä in te tetdä wutdä bärɛ ɛ jua̱th tetni da̱ŋ bäkɛl ti ba̱r ba̱a̱r. Kä bär kä kɛl ɛ juäth tetdä kɛnɛ pät tetdä. Kä cu dël pa̱a̱ny kɛnɛ bärɛ thɛm, kä cuɛ tekɛ taŋ kɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ wä kɛ pek thuɔk kal in lot ni käny ca̱ŋ, wëë nhial kɛ ko̱o̱tnikɛ, cuɛ tuut kal thɛm, cu bär jɔakdɛ a taŋ kɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä gëëkdɛ te duël ga̱a̱ŋni thi̱n, kä te duel ɔ kɛ theem taŋ kɛl, kä ɣäp ɣääpdɛ, taŋ kɛl kä bär jɔakdɛ. Kä kam duëli ɛ jua̱th tetni da̱ŋ dhieec. Kä thok pa̱a̱ny in la wä kɛ naath dueel in te rɛci bär jɔakdɛ ɛ taŋ kɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ duel in wäkɛ naath rɛc thɛm, cuɛ la juäth tetdä kɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ duel in te thok kal thɛm, cuɛ la jua̱th tetni da̱ŋ bädäk. Kä wääthnikɛ da̱ŋ rɛw kɛ jua̱th tetni da̱ŋ rɛw. Kä jɛn duel thuɔk kal in wäkɛ naath rɛc thieekɛ kɛ luaak Kuɔth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä te kui̱c ɔ kɛ duël da̱ŋ diɔ̱k ti te thok kal peek känyä ca̱ŋ. Kä kɛn da̱ŋ diɔ̱k päärkɛ, kä kɛn wääthni kui̱ni da̱ŋ rɛw päärkɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ɣäp ɣääp in lɛ̈pkɛ thok kal thi̱n thɛm, kä cuɛ la jua̱th tetni da̱ŋ wäl. Kä ɣäp ɣääp duɔ̱p thuɔk kal cuɛ la jua̱th tetni da̱ŋ wäl diɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nhiam duëli ga̱a̱ŋni peknikɛ da̱ŋ rɛw tëë kɛ käl da̱ŋ rɛw ti ciëk ciëëk, te mɔ kɛ juäth tetdä kɛl kä kɛn duël tëë kɛ jua̱th tetni da̱ŋ bäkɛl kui̱nikɛ diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kam duëël ga̱a̱ŋni kɛl ɛ wä duëël ga̱a̱ŋni min lot ni jɛ thɛm jɔkɔ, kä cuɛ jɛ jek a jua̱th tetni ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ dhieec kam kalɔ kɛnɛ kalɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ duel in te rɛci in la wä kɛ naath rɛy kal thɛm. Kä cuɛ jɛ jek ala jua̱th tetni ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw. Kä cu mäni thok in thieek kɛ wääthni kui̱cni diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A känɛ jɛ ni nhiam thuɔk kal in wä kɛ naath rɛc, a wä mäni thok kal in te rɛci, ɛ jua̱th tetni ti jiɛn da̱ŋ dhieec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛn duël kɛnɛ wäthnikiɛn tekɛ kɛ wernyini, rɛc ɔ kui̱ thuɔk in wä kɛ naath rɛc kui̱ ni diaal, kä te käl tin te rɛci kɛ wernyini bä. Kä ca wääthni biɛl kɛ jiɛn nööri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Rɛy kal raar",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ɣä naŋ kɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱p in wäkɛ naath rɛy kal in te raar. Kä ɛn wani te duël thi̱n, kä ca rɛy kal rɔth kɛ päm ni kɛɛliw, kä ca duël ti jiɛn da̱ŋ diɔ̱k car kä ro̱o̱th pa̱a̱m ɛmɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛn ro̱o̱th känɛ jɛ ni thok kal, wëë ce̱tnikɛ bär thukni käli. Kä mɛmɛ ɛ jɛn ro̱o̱th in te rɛcɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kam thuɔk kal raar rɛcɔ kɛnɛ rar thuɔk kal rɛ̈ci thɛm, kä cuɛ jɛ jek kɛ jua̱th tetni ti kuɔ̱r kɛl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Thok kal in te kui̱c caam",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ thok kal in te raar in te kui̱c cam thɛm, bärɛ kɛnɛ ɣäp ɣääpdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä te thok kal kɛ duël ga̱a̱ŋni da̱ŋ diɔ̱k peknikɛ diaal. Kä wääthnikɛ kɛnɛ duëlkɛ tin di̱t diaal päär theemnikiɛn kɛ theemni duëli thuɔk kal tëë nhiam tëë te kui̱c känyä ca̱ŋ. Bäriɛn kɛ jua̱th tetni ti jiɛn dhieec kä ɣäp ɣääpdiɛn kɛ jua̱th tetni ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ dhieec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä wernyinikɛ kɛnɛ wääthni kɛ jiɛn nöörikɛ päär theemnikiɛn kɛ theemni tëë te peek thuɔk kal in lot ni kui̱c känyä ca̱ŋ. Tëë kɛ ka̱a̱th da̱ŋ bärɔw wädu thok kal nhial, kä te wääthnikɛ rɛci. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamä thuɔk kal in lot ni kui̱c caam kɛnɛ thok kal in lot ni kui̱c känyä ca̱ŋ, te thuk ti wä kɛ naath rɛc thi̱n. Cuɛ kam thukni käli thɛm, cuɛ kɛ jek kɛ jua̱th tetni ti kuɔ̱r kɛl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
