          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ɣä lɛ naŋ kɛ kui̱c cuëëc, kä cu kui̱c cuëëc tekɛ thok kal, kä cuɛ wääthnikɛ kɛnɛ duël ga̱a̱ŋnikɛ thɛm. Kä cuɛ theemnikiɛn jek päärkɛ kɛ theemni thukni kal tin kɔ̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duël ga̱a̱ŋnikɛ kɛ bäŋdɛ tekɛ kɛ wernyini ti cakɛ go̱l kui̱cni diaal, ce̱tkɛ wernyini kä tin kɔ̱ŋ. Kä bärɛ ɛ jua̱th tetni ti jiɛn dhieec, kä ɣäp ɣääpdɛ kɛ jua̱th tetni ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ dhieec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tëë kɛ ko̱o̱tni da̱ŋ bärɔw ti wä kɛ naath nhial, kä te bäŋdɛ rɛci. Kä te wääthnikɛ kɛ jiɛn nööri, te kɛl kui̱c ɛmɛ kä te min dɔ̱ŋ peek in dɔ̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
