          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä te thok kal kuec cuëëc in te rɛci kɛ thi̱i̱k, kä cuɛ jɛ thɛm nikä thi̱i̱k in nhiam a wä kä thi̱i̱k in dɔ̱ŋ peek kuec cuëëc, kä cua jɛ jek kɛ jua̱th tetni ti kuɔ̱r kɛl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.27"
            ]
          }
        }
