          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä tëë kɛ duel mi ci nhiamdɛ luɔc thok kal in te kui̱c caam, mi ba muc tin waŋkɛ lak thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bäŋ thuɔk kal, kui̱cnikɛ diaal te mɔ kɛ tharbëtni da̱ŋ rɛw, tin la muc tin waŋ kɛ, kɛnɛ muc dui̱rä kɛ muc cutdä a ŋuɔ̱tkɛ thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä rar ba̱a̱ŋ, thuɔk kal kuec caam in la wäkɛ naath rɛc, tëë kɛ tharbëtni da̱ŋ rɛw, kä kui̱c in dɔ̱ŋ te tharbëtni rɛw ti kɔ̱ŋ thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä te tharbëtni ŋuaan rɛci, kä te tharbëtni da̱ŋ ŋuaan raar thok kal, kɛn diaal kɛ tharbëtni da̱ŋ bädäk ti la ŋuɔ̱tkɛ muc thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä tëë kɛ tharbëtni da̱ŋ ŋuaan ti kɔ̱ŋ ti ca la̱t kɛ pääm kɛ kui̱ mucni tin waŋkɛ, kä bäriɛn piny ɛ juäth tetdä kɛl kɛ nuth, kä ɣäp ɣääpdɛ ɛ juäth tetdä kɛl kɛ nuth, bärɛ nhial ɛ juäth tetdä, min la la̱thkɛ kuak tin la ŋuɔ̱tkɛ muc tin waŋkɛ thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä tëë kɛ thöt ti ca win puɔ̱ny duëël kɛɛliw ti bäriɛn ce̱tdɛ kɛ pät tetdä. Kɛ tharbët mi la ri̱ŋ mucni a la̱thkɛ thi̱n.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
